				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
		(property "Function" "Locking 4-way 2S pack connector: 1 PACK+, 2 BATT_MID (balance tap), 3 PACK-/GND, 4 BATT_NTC (10k 103AT); mounting tabs to GND. Layout: 4.0 mm inboard on B.Cu with the plug under the board (BM-01). MANDATORY PACK (P0-3): 2S Li-ion with an integrated per-cell PCM (cell UV cut-off 2.5-2.8 V, OV 4.30-4.35 V, discharge over-current and short-circuit protection), 10k 103AT NTC on pin 4, Molex Pico-Lock 205338 housing wired 1 PACK+ / 2 MID / 3 PACK- / 4 NTC. The board has no hardware deep-discharge cut-off: BQ25798 VBAT_UVLO (3.05-3.31 V) acts on the whole pack and U302/U303/BATP drain VBAT_PACK ahead of the ship FET; firmware stops RECORD at VBAT <= 6.6 V and shuts down at <= 6.2 V."
			(at 254 146.05 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
		)
